  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なな",
    "text": "「あっという間に翌朝ですねーっ☆」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なな",
    "text": "「んんっ、日本晴れ！　この世の春ですよーっ☆」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なな",
    "text": "「転校生くん、こっちこっち！　急ぎましょう、あたしが寝坊しちゃったせいでちょっと遅刻ぎみですから～っ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なな",
    "text": "「他の『臨海学校実行委員』は、もう現地に集まっちゃってるはずですよーっ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 3,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なな",
    "text": "「昨日は旅館に到着したらあとは『まったり』お風呂に入って寝るだけ、って感じでしたからねーっ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 3,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なな",
    "text": "「この二日目から、本格的に『臨海学校』の始まり始まり～っ☆」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 3,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なな",
    "text": "「転校生くんも実行委員なので、だいたいの予定はご存知ですよねーっ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 3,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なな",
    "text": "「いっしょに、『臨海学校のしおり』をつくりましたもんねーっ☆」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 3,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なな",
    "text": "「そうです、そうです！　二日目の午前中はまずお世話になる旅館への感謝をこめて建物と周辺の清掃、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なな",
    "text": "「または近場にある旅館の所有する畑で農作業ですーっ☆」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なな",
    "text": "「遊ぶのは午後の『自由時間』になってからですよーっ、まずはお仕事しませんと！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 3,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なな",
    "text": "「『清掃』か『農作業』かは好きなほうを選べる、って感じですけどねーっ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 3,
